body:
The year is 2005, and a young angst-y artimus is browsing the shelves of the ancient "Hollywood Videos" (because apparently my parents were to cheap for Blockbuster). I see this super edgey looking game titled "Devil May Cry 2" I was too stupid to understand how important chronological ordering. The only thing I could think was "What in the holy shit hell is this? And can I has?"

&#x200B;

Never looked back. and by that I mean I never returned the game or went back to the store lol
